{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "gymhub-overview",
  "title": "GymHub | Monitoreo general",
  "tags": [
    "GymHub",
    "SCRUM-67",
    "HIA"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Fuente Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "regex": "/^Prometheus-GymHub$/",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "hide": 0,
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Backend disponible",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "1 = healthcheck HTTP OK; 0 = fallo. URL local de laboratorio.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "probe_success{instance=\"http://host.docker.internal:3000/api/health\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Frontend Docker disponible",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "1 = proxy Nginx → API funciona.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "probe_success{instance=\"http://host.docker.internal:8081/api/health\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "PostgreSQL primario disponible",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Exportador confirma acceso a PostgreSQL.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "pg_up{job=\"postgres-primary\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Series CPU de contenedores",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Número de series de contenedores, no identidad de contenedores ni estado de reinicios.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{job=\"cadvisor\",id=~\"/docker/[0-9a-f]+\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "CPU del entorno Docker (%)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "node-exporter mide principalmente la VM Linux de Docker Desktop, no el hardware completo del Mac.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node-exporter\",mode=\"idle\"}[5m])))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "CPU VM",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Memoria del entorno Docker (%)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Memoria Linux observada por node-exporter (VM Docker).",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"node-exporter\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{job=\"node-exporter\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "Memoria VM",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Disco Linux libre (bytes)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Sujeto a las etiquetas y montajes visibles en Docker Desktop.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"node-exporter\",mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "Disco {{mountpoint}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Tráfico recibido (bytes/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Tráfico de interfaces que ve node-exporter.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (device) (rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{job=\"node-exporter\",device!~\"lo|veth.*\"}[5m]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "RX {{device}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Tráfico enviado (bytes/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Tráfico de interfaces que ve node-exporter.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (device) (rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{job=\"node-exporter\",device!~\"lo|veth.*\"}[5m]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "TX {{device}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "CPU por contenedor (núcleos)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Cada línea se identifica por ID /docker/<hash>. No hay etiqueta name/image garantizada.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{job=\"cadvisor\",id=~\"/docker/[0-9a-f]+\"}[5m])",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{id}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Memoria de contenedores (bytes)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Memoria working set reportada por cAdvisor.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "container_memory_working_set_bytes{job=\"cadvisor\",id=~\"/docker/[0-9a-f]+\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{id}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Contenedores observados recientemente",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Número de series observadas, no prueba de que todos los contenedores activos estén cubiertos.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(container_last_seen{job=\"cadvisor\",id=~\"/docker/[0-9a-f]+\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Transacciones PostgreSQL por segundo",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "TPS aproximado; solo base demo_hia y exportador primario.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(pg_stat_database_xact_commit{job=\"postgres-primary\",datname=\"demo_hia\"}[5m])) + sum(rate(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback{job=\"postgres-primary\",datname=\"demo_hia\"}[5m]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "Transacciones/s",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Cache hit ratio PostgreSQL (%)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Ratio de bloques en caché para la BD primaria.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(pg_stat_database_blks_hit{job=\"postgres-primary\",datname=\"demo_hia\"}) / clamp_min(sum(pg_stat_database_blks_hit{job=\"postgres-primary\",datname=\"demo_hia\"}) + sum(pg_stat_database_blks_read{job=\"postgres-primary\",datname=\"demo_hia\"}), 1)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "Cache hit",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Tamaño de la base demo_hia (bytes)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 45,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "El exporter puede no exponer esta serie según versión/permisos.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "pg_database_size_bytes{job=\"postgres-primary\",datname=\"demo_hia\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "Tamaño",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "title": "Conexiones activas PostgreSQL",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 45,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Sesiones concurrentes en la base de datos demo_hia.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "pg_stat_database_numbackends{job=\"postgres-primary\",datname=\"demo_hia\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "Conexiones",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "title": "Reinicios de contenedores — pendiente",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 53,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "⚠️ **Pendiente:** cAdvisor expone métricas de CPU y memoria, pero no se ha verificado una serie fiable del **contador real de reinicios**. No se debe mostrar un conteo inventado. Añadir una métrica oficial o verificada y evidencia."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "title": "Consultas SQL lentas — pendiente",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 53,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "⚠️ **Pendiente:** integrar `pg_stat_statements` y exporter/consulta adecuada. Los tiempos de respuesta de consultas individuales **no** se infieren de TPS o cache hit."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "title": "Replicación — pendiente",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 58,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "⚠️ **Pendiente de integración:** conectar el exporter de la réplica y medir estado/lag de streaming real. No se demuestra replicación con `pg_up` del primario."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Notas de operación",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 58,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Dashboard local de **GymHub**. Los valores de `node-exporter` representan mayormente la VM Docker Desktop en Mac. Los servicios **no deben exponerse** a Internet. El panel se provisiona desde el repositorio; no contiene credenciales."
      }
    }
  ]
}
